---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Captio — intake · brief · team"
  description="Captio turns the first client contact into a structured process that ends with an AI-generated brief ready for the lawyer — before the first call."
  activePage="home"
>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     HERO
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center pt-20 pb-16 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-[700px] h-[700px] rounded-full bg-[#3B6FE8]/6 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 -left-40 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-[#1B2E5E]/5 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full relative">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[2fr_3fr] gap-16 items-center">

      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#EEF1F8] text-[#3B6FE8] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-7 fade-up">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B6FE8] animate-pulse"></span>
          intake · brief · team
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#1B2E5E] leading-[1.05] mb-6 fade-up d1">
          Client fills.<br>Lawyer arrives<br><span class="text-[#3B6FE8]">prepared.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg text-[#6B7694] leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md fade-up d2">
          Captio turns the first client contact into a structured process that ends with an AI-generated summary ready for the lawyer — before the first call.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 fade-up d3">
          <a href="/pricing/#trial" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#3B6FE8] hover:bg-[#2d5fd4] text-white font-bold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#3B6FE8]/30 text-base">
            Request access
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#1B2E5E] font-semibold px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d4daf0] hover:bg-white hover:border-[#3B6FE8]/40 transition-all text-base">
            See how it works
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[#A0A8BF] fade-up d4">
          From $79 / month · Per firm, not per user
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dashboard screenshot -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block fade-up d2">
        <div class="relative img-float">
          <div class="absolute inset-4 bg-[#3B6FE8]/12 rounded-3xl blur-2xl"></div>
          <img
            src="https://res.cloudinary.com/do144qmdb/image/upload/v1780959549/captio/en/tutorial_lytudg.webp"
            alt="Captio — client history"
            class="relative w-full rounded-2xl border-4 border-white shadow-2xl shadow-[#1B2E5E]/30 ring-1 ring-[#d4daf0]"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     PROBLEM
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="problems" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1B2E5E] mb-4">
        The problems most firms<br class="hidden sm:block"> carry without fixing
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
        These aren't failures of the lawyers. They're failures of the process. Captio puts the process in order.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">Intake is improvised</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          There's no standard process for the first consultation. Every lawyer handles it differently and information arrives incomplete — in formats only they understand. The first client meeting becomes data collection instead of strategy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h10M4 18h6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">Cases are scattered everywhere</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Emails, handwritten notes, WhatsApp threads, files in three different folders. Without a central case file, delegating means whoever takes over starts from zero — not knowing what was promised, what's missing, or what's already done.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">The team works out of sync</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Two lawyers ask the client the same questions. Case updates travel by WhatsApp or don't travel at all. Without shared real-time visibility, the team can't coordinate — only react.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">Deadlines are tracked manually</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Someone has to log into the court system, check for updates, and alert the lawyer. One missed notification can lose the case. A missed deadline through oversight creates liability — and there's no process to prevent it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">Firm management operates blind</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          How many active cases are there? Which ones are stalled? What is each lawyer working on this week? Without a dashboard, firm management is reactive — problems surface only when it's too late to act.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FFF8F8] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#FECACA]/50">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#EF4444]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] mb-2 text-[15px]">Information gets lost between apps</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Strategy notes live in a separate doc. Research sits in a bookmark. Call notes are somewhere else entirely. Nothing reaches the case file where it belongs — and when you need it, nobody knows where it is.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     HOW IT WORKS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#F8F9FC]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1B2E5E] mb-4">
        Your entire firm,<br class="hidden sm:block"> managed in one place
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Captio connects intake, case files, your team, and your clients — without switching between apps or losing context.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#EEF1F8] p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-[#3B6FE8]/5 transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#3B6FE8]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#3B6FE8]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] text-lg mb-2">AI Intake</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          The client fills the form from their device and AI generates a structured 10-section brief in seconds. Five ways to start a case: client link, manual entry, import from document, guided interview, or free write — whichever fits the situation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#EEF1F8] p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-[#3B6FE8]/5 transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#3B6FE8]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#3B6FE8]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] text-lg mb-2">The complete case file</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Each case has its own operational timeline, notes notebook, related documents, legal research from Mexico's SCJN, and federal court monitoring. Every thread of the case in one place — visible to the entire team in real time, in the whole world.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#EEF1F8] p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-[#3B6FE8]/5 transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#3B6FE8]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#3B6FE8]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] text-lg mb-2">Team in sync</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Real-time notification board, task manager linked to cases, and four distinct roles — firm admin, lawyer, and assistant. Every team member sees exactly what they need. No update gets lost between a call and the office.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#EEF1F8] p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-[#3B6FE8]/5 transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#3B6FE8]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#3B6FE8]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B2E5E] text-lg mb-2">Firm overview</h3>
        <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Dashboard with key firm metrics, client directory linked to their cases, and a full team activity log. Everything you need to run the firm — without opening a spreadsheet.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     FEATURES
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="features" class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1B2E5E] mb-4">
        Everything the firm needs
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B7694] text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
        From the first contact to case notes — in one place.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      {[
        {
          icon: 'M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1',
          title: 'Create a case — 5 ways',
          desc: "Client link, manual form, import from a document, interview the client section by section, or write freely. The case reaches the lawyer's dashboard regardless of the method.",
        },
        {
          icon: 'M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4',
          title: '6-section intake form',
          desc: 'Captures everything relevant: facts, goals, documents, parties, and conflict of interest. With contextual guidance in each field.',
        },
        {
          icon: 'M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z',
          title: 'AI-generated brief',
          desc: 'Claude (Anthropic) generates the brief in seconds. 10 sections. Faithful to the answers — never fabricates.',
        },
        {
